{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0203_1000_p", "source_sha256": "07847f3435144ecbe65570f832a4ed3c0844886e3e2de145a1cf947b1a760df3", "ja": "（今日のレッスンは……おっと、ロコか。\nちょっと様子を見に行ってみるかな）", "zh": "（今天的课程是……哦，原来是ROCO啊。去稍微看看情况吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0203_1001_025roc", "source_sha256": "41d5910d139270033f2f5140d181d81d4bad6b9889b0d44f0a1f78bef93914d1", "ja": "うぅ……さすがにハードワークのあとが……\nいたた……。", "zh": "呜……超负荷练习之后果然还是会……\n好痛痛痛……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0203_1002_p", "source_sha256": "1cdb0446b01805e42d444826edcf10256cbd0031a7a7ea2bf38efc611d07b977", "ja": "ロコ、お疲れさま。レッスンの調子は……。\nって、どうしたんだ？　なんだかつらそうだけど。", "zh": "ROCO，辛苦了。练习的情况……等等，你这是怎么了？看起来好像很难受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0203_1003_025roc", "source_sha256": "075261d37386a11b1149c349bebe8359f4e00c6931cd2e8c56f75e771ce27f00", "ja": "{$P$}！　じ、実は、うう……。\nロコは、マッスルペインなんです！", "zh": "{$P$}！其、其实，呜呜……。\nROCO是肌肉疼啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0203_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "b78150123430eac4a509a4bbe6ad08240f46d78d6023df9cd2bb7991526c5e35", "ja": "昨日のスポーツフェスティバルで、\nちょっと頑張りすぎてしまって……いたっ、いたた。", "zh": "昨天的运动会，\n稍微太拼了……哎哟，哎哟哟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0203_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6e5a7a948b71fea909d82d7bbcebc4b81a9875276eb68c9a8baee8e342b96f44", "ja": "ああ、筋肉痛か。ロコも筋肉痛になるんだな……。\nそんなにつらいなら、今日は休んだらどうだ？", "zh": "啊，是肌肉酸痛啊。原来ROCO也会肌肉酸痛……。\n要是这么难受，今天休息一下怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0203_1006_025roc", "source_sha256": "f423c9002bebc4273894104176097e7c39d1e9d589098ef0ad54d80b4ed7e38d", "ja": "いっ、いえ、大じょう……いたっ、いたたたた……！", "zh": "没、没事的……痛、好痛痛痛痛……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0203_1007_p", "source_sha256": "fd8f93c3e70ca6d8c73cb52f610b2e51d6802cac7994ca91db1a44c7eab14fac", "ja": "ほら、無理しなくていいから。\n今日は軽くストレッチだけして、休みにしよう。", "zh": "好了，不用勉强自己。\n今天就简单做做拉伸，然后休息吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0203_1008_025roc", "source_sha256": "5c4a41224fe00ef653b4175fc6c47e6c167bfee46269bd185137ba1bc4101b1a", "ja": "わ、わかりました……うぅ。\n少しだけ、レストさせてもらいますね。", "zh": "我、我知道了……呜呜。\n那我就稍微休息（Rest）一下哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0203_1009_025roc", "source_sha256": "87d1d08071638ea48b19eef07cace8a36f804572e58deb003461cf96ed871d65", "ja": "ソーリーです。{$P$}、\n心配をさせてしまって。", "zh": "抱歉，{$P$}，让你担心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0203_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a2a42575e23bda639f941f17ee69c37cffb748316813351c54790ec665520291", "ja": "別に謝らなくていいって。むしろ、頑張ってくれて\n感謝してるよ。ゆっくり休んでくれ。", "zh": "不用道歉啦。倒是要谢谢你这么努力。好好休息吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0203_1011_025roc", "source_sha256": "09d486a9494b13b4047d50a5b62eb47f0ae155ba2263c7d70dbabe2460acd594", "ja": "わかりました、サンクスです！　でも、\nこのままではロコのスピリットが収まらないので……。", "zh": "明白了，谢谢！不过，\n这样下去，ROCO的灵魂是无法平静下来的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0203_1012_025roc", "source_sha256": "c2e3c5206bc294bbe7d0e2b2f22aa126f007660ae6a4e634e365db4b8b1ee9ec", "ja": "レッスンのかわりに、美術館に行って、\nインスピレーションをリチャージしてきますね！", "zh": "我不去上课，改去美术馆，给灵感充充电再回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0203_1013_p", "source_sha256": "902a408b8488b93f6de4f25b2e43af4bee450dae994f2a61cfab9f002a6b79d1", "ja": "えっ、大丈夫なのか？\nやる気があるのはいいけど、無理はしないでくれよ！", "zh": "咦，没问题吗？\n有干劲是好事，但可别勉强自己啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0203_1014_025roc", "source_sha256": "79357488d630cf9a9113f471d0de8fc52c281f7331648b69ed4d19f67924747a", "ja": "ノープロブレムです！　\nアートを見れば、ロコは元気になるんですよ♪", "zh": "没问题！只要看看艺术，ROCO就会精神起来哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_025roc0203_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_025roc0203_1015_025roc", "source_sha256": "9b13a8d29cbdeb02c06b79c46004dfd2843c6b580a2d37e4fd0ca0b4e16abfe6", "ja": "イメージを膨らませて、次のレッスンで新しい\nアイドルスタイルを、ドローイングしてみせますから！", "zh": "我会拓展想象，在下次课程中画出全新的偶像风格给你看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
